{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10127061","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10127061","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012706101:0":{"text":"로잔, 너는 따스한 바람처럼 먹구름을 쫓아내곤 해.","source_cn":"洛桑，你像煦风一般，总能吹散阴霾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F69AEFA4B842ADB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012706102:0":{"text":"라이카, 너는 별처럼 내 마음속의 어둠을 비춰주었지.","source_cn":"莱卡，你如同星辰，照亮了我内心的黑暗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACEB8D8CCDF8C850","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012706103:0":{"text":"아든 선생님, 당신의 가르침이 없었다면 저도 없었을 겁니다.","source_cn":"雅顿老师，没有你的教诲，便没有今日的我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA80989E1B0F56263","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012706104:0":{"text":"다프니 할머니, 제 마음속에 할머니는 언제나 강한 전사에요.","source_cn":"达赫妮婆婆，在我心中，你永远是强大的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x052DF1460C730741","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012706105:0":{"text":"그리고 브라이언, 패리사, 프라벨... 동료가 없었다면 난 여기까지 오지 못했을 거야.","source_cn":"还有布莱恩、帕瑞莎、芙拉贝尔……没有伙伴，我无法走到今天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC6B6FD39BCF8E60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}}